<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank forex reserves $12.984 bln end-Aug.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank forex reserves $12.984 bln end-Aug.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign exchange reserves of the Czech National Bank (CNB) rose to $12.984 billion as of the end of August from $12.974 billion at the end of July, the CNB said in a statement.  </p>
<p>  CZECH FOREX RESERVES	AUG 1996    JULY 1996     AUG 1995</p>
<p>   Czech National Bank	 $12.984     $12.974	 $11.9</p>
<p>   Gross Reserves		$16.552     $16.575	 $14.5</p>
<p>Note: Measures through end of period listed. Gross reserves include all Czech banking institutions including the CNB (central bank)</p>
<p>-- John Mastrini, Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
